#: about.php include/global_arrays.php lib/html.php
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Momba ny Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Ny Cacti dia natao ho vahaolana feno amin'ny famoronana kisary miorina amin'ny angon-drakitra ara-potoana RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) sy ny vahaolana fanaovana kisary. Ny tanjony dia ny hanamora ny asan'ny Mpitantana Tambajotra amin'ny alalan'ny fikarakarana ireo antsipiriany manan-danja rehetra ilaina amin'ny famoronana Kisary misy dikany."

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Jereo azafady ny %1$stranonkala ofisialin'ny Cacti%2$s raha mila fanazavana momba ny fampiasana ny Cacti, ny fahazoana fanampiana, ary ny fanavaozana."

#: about.php
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Mpamorona mavitrika"

#: about.php
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Ireo mpamorona miasa amin'ny Cacti, ny rafiny, ny tahirin-kevitra ary ny famoahana ho avy."

#: about.php
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Fankasitrahana manokana"

#: about.php
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Ireo mpandray anjara amin'ny tahirin-kevitra, ny fanaraha-maso kalitao (QA), ny famonosana rindrankajy, ny sehatra fifanakalozan-kevitra ary ny pejinay ao amin'ny YouTube."

#: about.php
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Mpikambana zokiolona teo aloha"

#: about.php
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Mpikambana tao amin'ny Vondrona Cacti voalohany izay efa nifindra lalana tamin'ny asany. Mirary soa hatrany ho azy ireo izahay."

#: about.php
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Fisaorana"

#: about.php
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Fisaorana manokana ho an'i %1$sTobi Oetiker%2$s, ilay namorona ny %3$sRRDtool%4$s sy ilay %5$sMRTG%6$s malaza dia malaza."

#: about.php
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Ireo mpampiasa ny Cacti"

#: about.php
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Indrindra fa izay rehetra nanokana fotoana nanao tatitra momba ny olana, na nanampy tamin'ny famahana ny olana mifandraika amin'ny Cacti. Ary koa ho an'izay rehetra nandray anjara tamin'ny fanohanana ny Cacti."

#: about.php
msgid "License"
msgstr "Fahazoan-dalana"

#: about.php
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Ny Cacti dia nahazo fahazoan-dalana amin'ny alalan'ny GNU GPL:"

#: about.php lib/installer.php
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Ity rindrankajy ity dia rindrankajy malalaka; azonao zaraina indray sy/na ovaina araka ny fepetran'ny GNU General Public License izay navoakan'ny Free Software Foundation; na ny kinova faha-2 amin'ny Fahazoan-dalana, na ny kinova vaovao kokoa manaraka."

#: about.php
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Ity rindrankajy ity dia zaraina amin'ny fanantenana fa hahasoa, saingy TSY MISY ANTOKA; na dia ny antoka an-kolaka momba ny FAHAMENDREHANA HO AN'NY VAROTRA na ny FAHAFENOANA HO AN'NY TANJONA MANOKANA aza. Jereo ny GNU General Public License raha mila antsipiriany bebe kokoa."

