#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny Fanampiana momba ny Taratasy Fenoina sy Fandrindrana dia haseho eo an-toerana. Raha tsy izany dia haseho izany rehefa manatona eo ambonin'ny bokotra fanampiana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Fanampiana Pejy Eo An-toerana Ihany"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Amin'ny alalan'ny fandrindrana fototra dia ao amin'ny docs.cacti.net no misy ny fanampiana pejy Cacti. Na izany aza, raha tsy mahazo Aterineto ny rafitrao, dia azonao alaina eo an-toerana amin'ny endrika HTML ny antontan-taratasy fanampiana ary apetraka ao amin'ny toerana 'docs' amin'ny lohamilinao Cacti. Raha misafidy ny hampiasa ny toerana eo an-toerana ihany ianao ho an'ny antontan-taratasy fanampiana pejy, mariho ity boaty fanamarinana ity."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Fanamarinana ny Famafana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Manontania ny mpampiasa alohan'ny hamafana singa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Fandrindrana Mialoha ny Fitehirizana Loharanon'angona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Rehefa alefa, ny Cacti dia hametraka ny Bokotra Radio ho Famafana ireo Loharanon'angona mifandraika amin'ny Kisary iray rehefa manala Kisary. Fanamarihana: Tsy hamela ny fanesorana Loharanon'angona ny Cacti raha toa ka ampiasaina amin'ny Kisary hafa izy ireo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Famahana Kisary Ho Azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Rehefa alefa, tsy hanidy ny Kisary ny Cacti. Izany dia ahafahana manova haingana kokoa an-tanana ny Loharanon'angona mifandraika amin'ny Kisary iray."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Afeno ny Tabilao Fanaraha-maso Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Ampiasaina miaraka amin'ny Fanohanana Rohy Ivelany an'ny Cacti. Amin'ny fampiasana ity fandrindrana ity, azonao afenina ny Tabilao Fanaraha-maso Cacti, mba hahafahanao mampiseho ny pejinao manokana fotsiny."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Alefaso ny Fitarihana sy Fametrahana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Ny sasany amin'ireo seha-pifandraisana Cacti dia manohana ny Fitarihana sy Fametrahana. Raha voamarika dia halefa ity safidy ity. Fanamarihana: Ho an'ny mpampiasa manana fahasembanana ara-pahitana, azo ajanona ity safidy ity."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Fiarovana ny Tranonkala"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Terena Handalo HTTPS ny Fifandraisana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Rehefa voamarika, ny andrana rehetra hiditra amin'ny Cacti dia havily mankany amin'ny HTTPS mba hiantohana fiarovana avo lenta."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Avelao ny mpanangona angona lavitra HTTPS tsy azo antoka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Avelao ny fampiasana taratasy fanamarinana nosoniavin-tena ary avelao ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano ao amin'ny taratasy fanamarinana ho hafa noho ny an'ny mpanangona angona lavitra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Avelao ny metacharacters tsy azo antoka amin'ny fomba fampidirana angona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Taloha, ny mpitantana Cacti dia namorona fomba fampidirana angona tsotra ahitana baiko toy ny \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" mba hanehoana sanda ara-isa ampiasaina amin'ny kisary Cacti. Tamin'ireo kinova taloha an'ny Cacti dia navela izany. Na izany aza, fomba fanao tsy azo antoka izany satria varavarana ahafahan'ny mpampiasa avy any ivelany mamoaka lasitra angona tsy azo antoka. Amin'ny Cacti maoderina dia tokony hohalavirina ny fomba fanao toy izany. Na izany aza, manolotra ity safidy ity izahay raha manana fomba fampidirana angona tranainy ianao izay ahitana ireo metacharacters tsy azo antoka ireo ary mbola tsy navadikao ho script eo an-toerana ao amin'ny lahatahiry 'scripts'. Rehefa tsy voamarika ity safidy ity dia mametra ny metacharacters karazana shell toy ny marika famerim-bolana, fonon-teny miolaka, tsipika mitsangana, tsipika miverina, ary marika apostrofa miverina ny Cacti. Mbola avelan'ny Cacti ihany ny marika lehibe noho sy kely noho ho an'ny zavatra toy ny <path_cacti> sy ho an'ny mari-pamantarana fampidirana, saingy raha tsy voamarika ity safidy ity dia izay ihany no fetran'ny fampiasana azy ireo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Politikan'ny Script Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Mifehy ny politikan'ny CSP script-src. Amin'ny fomba Nonce, ny fanampin'ny Cacti (Plugins) izay mampiasa JavaScript anatiny dia tsy maintsy ahitana ny toetra nonce avy amin'ny fiasa anatiny an'ny Cacti 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Raha tsy izany dia hosakanan'ny mpitety tranonkala ireo script ireo. Amin'izao fotoana izao dia manao tatitra ihany ny Cacti momba ireo fanampin'ny Cacti izay tsy mampiasa tsara ny fomba Nonce. Amin'ny ho avy dia havelanay ny mpitantana hanakana ireo fanampiny ireo tsy hampiasa ny JavaScript anatiny raha tsy mampiasa Nonces izy ireo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Avelao ny JavaScript anatiny tsy misy Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Avelao na ny unsafe-eval na ny JavaScript anatiny tsy misy Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Fomba Nonce - Tatitra ihany"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI tatitra fandikana ny CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL izay andefasan'ny mpitety tranonkala POST ny tatitra momba ny fandikana CSP amin'ny fomba nonce-report sy nonce. Avelao ho foana raha hampiasa <url_path>/csp_report.php. Tsy maintsy ahitana soratra URL azo antoka ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Loharano hafa ho an'ny Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Anaran-tsehatra sarahin'ny elanelana izay mahazo alalana ho azo idirana avy any ivelan'ny Mpizara Tranonkala mihitsy. Zava-dehibe izany ho an'ireo mpampiasa misafidy ny hampiasa CDN, na tranonkala fampiantranoana. Ny loharano dia afaka ahitana karatra manolo (wildcards), ohatra: *.mydomain.com, na protokoly, ohatra: https://*.example.com. Ireo Loharano Hafa ireo dia tsy ahitana afa-tsy karazana Sary, CSS ary JavaScript ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL handefasan'ny mpitety tranonkala tatitra momba ny fanitsakitsahana CSP amin'ny alalan'ny POST ao amin'ny fomba nonce-report sy nonce. Avelao ho foana raha hampiasa /cacti/csp_report.php ao amin'ny fakan'ny fametrahana. Tsy maintsy ahitana soratra URL azo antoka ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Alefa ny famoronana kisary ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Rehefa tsy alefa dia tsy hamorona kisary mivantana ny Fandehanana ho azy Cacti. Ilaina izany rehefa manitsy ny fandrindrana Fitaovana mba hisorohana ny famoronana kisary vaovao isaky ny mitahiry zavatra iray ianao. Mbola azo atao ihany ny miantso ny Fitsipika Fandehanana ho azy amin'ny tanana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Alefa ny famoronana singa hazo ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Rehefa tsy alefa dia tsy hamorona singa hazo mivantana ny Fandehanana ho azy Cacti. Ilaina izany rehefa manitsy ny fandrindrana Fitaovana na Kisary mba hisorohana ny famoronana fampidirana hazo vaovao isaky ny mitahiry zavatra iray ianao. Mbola azo atao ihany ny miantso ny Fitsipika amin'ny tanana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Mailaka handefasana ny fampandrenesana Fandehanana ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Ny adiresy mailaka handefasana ny mailaka fampandrenesana Fandehanana ho azy raha tsy voafaritra eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Tambajotra Fandehanana ho azy. Raha avela ho foana na ity saha ity na ny sandan'ny Tambajotra Fandehanana ho azy, dia hampiasa ny kaonty mailaky ny Mpitantana Cacti voalohany ny Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Anaran'ny mpandefa ny fampandrenesana Fandehanana ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Ny anarana mailaka ampiasaina amin'ny mailaka fampandrenesana Fandehanana ho azy raha tsy voafaritra eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Tambajotra Fandehanana ho azy. Raha avela ho foana na ity saha ity na ny sandan'ny Tambajotra Fandehanana ho azy, dia hampiasa ny Anaran'ny mpandefa mahazatra ao amin'ny rafitra ny Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Mailaky ny mpandefa ny fampandrenesana Fandehanana ho azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Ny adiresy mailaka ampiasaina amin'ny mailaka fampandrenesan'ny Fampandehanana ho azy raha tsy voatondro eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Tambajotran'ny fampandehanana ho azy. Raha avela ho banga na ity saha ity na ny sandan'ny Tambajotran'ny fampandehanana ho azy, dia hampiasa ny adiresy mailaka mpandefa lasitra an'ny rafitra ny Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Sanda voafaritra mialoha ho an'ny môdelin-kisary"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Fitsapana ny loharanon'angona ho an'ny môdelin-kisary"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Mariho ity boaty fikosehana ity raha te hitsapa ny Loharanon'angona alohan'ny famoronana azy ianao ho an'ireo Môdelin-kisary vaovao sy vao nafarana. Rehefa alefa ny Fitsapana loharanon'angona, raha tsy mamerina angona manankery ny Loharanon'angona, dia tsy ho voaforona ny Kisary. Zava-dehibe ity fanamboarana ity raha maniry hanana Môdelim-pitaovana ankapobeny kokoa izay afaka ahitana Môdelin-kisary maromaro azo ampiharina arakaraka ny toetran'ny Fitaovana ianao. Fanamarihana: Raha manana script maharitra ela ianao amin'ny maha-Loharanon'angona azy, dia hitombo ny fotoana hamoronana ny Kisary."

