msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Ny elanelam-potoana fanangonana ampiasaina.  Hisy fiantraikany amin'ny fahatetehan'ny fanamarinana sy fanavaozana ny RRDfiles ity fandrindrana ity.  <strong><u>FANAMARIHANA: Raha manova ity sanda ity ianao, dia tsy maintsy mameno indray ny cache-n'ny poller.  Ny tsy fanaovana izany dia mety hiteraka fahaverezan'angona.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
