msgstr "Raha misafidy ity safidy ity ianao, dia hanamarina ny vokatra mihoatra ny fahafahan'ny Cacti mitahiry azy ny Cacti ary hamoaka fampitandremana rehefa mahita izany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Fe-potoana fiandrasana ny mpandraharaha lavitra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Ny fe-potoana, amin'ny segondra, hiandrasan'ny mpizara tranonkala Cacti foibe ny valiny avy amin'ny Mpanangona angona lavitra mba hahazoana fampahalalana isan-karazany momba ny Fitaovana alohan'ny hanajanonana ny fangatahana. Amin'ireo Fitaovana mifandray amin'ny Mpanangona angona hafa ankoatra ny Mpanangona angona Cacti foibe dia tsy maintsy ampiasaina ny Agent lavitra mba hanangonana ny fampahalalana momba ny Fitaovana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Fanavaozana ny tabilaon'ny Poller isaky ny tsingerina"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Ity fandrindrana ity dia natao ho an'ny rafitra manana poller tokana ihany mba hananganana indray ny tabilaon'ny vokatry ny poller amin'ny tsingerina fanangonana tsirairay mba hisorohana ny tabilaon'ny fitadidiana tsy hampiasa swap amin'ny rafitra lehibe dia lehibe manana angon-drakitra lehibe izay mety hampiasa swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Atsaharo ny fampitoviana ny Cache-n'ny loharano"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Amin'ny alalan'ny fandrindrana fototra, ny Mpanangona angona fototra Cacti dia hitahiry ny tranonkala manontolo sy ny plugins ao amin'ny Tahiry loharano. Avy eo, manavao ny tenany tsindraindray amin'ny fanavaozana rehetra avy amin'ny Mpanangona angona fototra Cacti ireo Mpanangona angona lavitra. Ity Tahiry loharano ity dia mamela ny Mpanangona angona lavitra hanavao ny tenany ho azy. Raha tsy te hampiasa ity safidy ity ianao dia azonao atao ny manafoana azy amin'ny alalan'ity fandrindrana ity."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Fomba fiasan'ny SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Fanohanana SNMP Agent alefa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Raha voamarika ity safidy ity, dia hameno ny tabilaon'ny SNMP Agent amin'ny mombamomba ny fitaovana sy ny rafitra Cacti ny Cacti. Tsy mandefa ny SNMP Agent mihitsy izany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Alefaso ny MD5 sy DES ho an'ny SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Efa tranainy, malemy, ary tsy hita amin'ireo PHP sy Net-SNMP nohamafisina (FIPS) ny algôritma fanamarinana MD5 sy tsiambaratelo DES. Rehefa tsy alefa, dia esorina ao amin'ny lisitra fidina ho an'ny Prôtôkôly fanamarinana sy tsiambaratelo SNMPv3 aseho rehefa manova Fitaovana sy ao amin'ny Safidy SNMP amin'ny Fampandehanana ho azy ny MD5 sy DES, ka ny algôritma SHA sy AES matanjaka kokoa ihany no tavela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Alefaso ny fitahirizana vonjimaika ny mari-panamarinana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Hamafiso mialoha ary tehirizo vonjimaika indray mandeha isaky ny fanovana mari-panamarinana ireo mari-pamantarana SNMPv3 mba hampiasan'ny fizotran'ny poller tsirairay azy indray fa tsy hanamboarana azy amin'ny fangatahana rehetra. Mitondra fitsitsiana kely izany rehefa manangona angona amin'ny mari-panamarinana SNMPv3 amin'ny alalan'ny rakitra azo tanterahina Net-SNMP. Ny fanitarana php-snmp dia mitantana ny ankamaroan'ny fangatahana get SNMPv3 ao anatiny ihany ary mandingana ity fitahirizana vonjimaika ity, saingy mbola ampiasaina ihany ny rakitra azo tanterahina Net-SNMP (ary noho izany ity fitahirizana vonjimaika ity) ho an'ny SNMP walk, vokatra hex, fangatahana mametraka context na engine id, ary fitambarana prôtôkôly tsy tohanan'ny kinova PHP mandeha. Alefaso ity raha manangona iray amin'ireo asa ireo amin'ny mari-panamarinana SNMPv3 ianao."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Get OID Limit"
msgstr "Fetran'ny SNMP Get OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Ny isa ambony indrindra voafaritra mialoha amin'ny SNMP Get OIDs halefa isaky ny fangatahana snmpget. Ho an'ny Fitaovana, io fanamboarana io dia fehezina eo amin'ny ambaratongan'ny Fitaovana. Tsy tokony hampiasa ity fanamboarana ity ianao raha tsy mampiasa mivantana ny API SNMP an'ny Cacti ao amin'ny script na plugin-nao."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Haben'ny Fandraisana SNMP Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Firy ny OID tokony haverina isaky ny fangatahana snmpbulkwalk? Ho an'ny Fitaovana manana hazo SNMP lehibe, ny fampitomboana izany habe izany dia hampitombo ny fahombiazan'ny famerenana fanondroana amin'ny tambajotra WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Atsaharo ny fanamarinana ny fitomboan'ny OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Mifehy ny fampiatoana ny fanamarinana ny fitomboan'ny OID mandritra ny fitetezana ny hazo OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Fandrindrana fanampiny ho an'ny Mpanangona angona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Firaketana angona tsy manan-kery"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Ahoana no tianao hiraketana ny hadisoan'ny vokatra avy amin'ny Mpanangona angona? Anisan'ny safidy ny: 'Antsipiriany' izay manazava ny hadisoana tsirairay, 'Famintinana' izay manome ny isan'ny hadisoan'ny vokatra isaky ny Fitaovana, ary 'Tsy misy', izay tsy manome ny isan'ny hadisoana."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Famintinana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Antsipiriany"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Isan'ny Mpizara Script PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Ny isan'ny dingan'ny mpizara script mandeha miaraka alefa isaky ny dingana spine. Ekena ny sanda eo anelanelan'ny 1 sy 15. Hanampy ity masontsivana ity raha mampandeha kofehy (threads) sy script mpizara script maromaro ianao, ary tsy manan-kery afa-tsy ho an'ny Mpanangona angona spine ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Sanda fetra fotoana ho an'ny Script sy ny Mpizara Script"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Ny fotoana farafahabetsany hiandrasan'ny spine ny fahavitan'ny skripta iray. Segondra no fandrefesana ity sandan'ny fe-potoana ity ary tsy manan-kery afa-tsy ho an'ny Mpanangona Angona spine ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Periodic All Device Re-Index"
msgstr "Fanavaozana tondro tsindraindray ho an'ny Fitaovana rehetra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Re-Index All Device Schedule"
msgstr "Fandaharam-potoana fanavaozana tondro ho an'ny Fitaovana rehetra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "At what frequency do you wish to Re-Index all Devices.  This Re-Index will occur at midnight at the frequency that you select."
msgstr "Amin'ny elanelam-potoana manao ahoana no tianao hanavaozana tondro ny Fitaovana rehetra. Hitranga amin'ny misasakalina araka ny elanelam-potoana nofidinao ity fanavaozana tondro ity."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly on Sunday"
msgstr "Isan-kerinandro amin'ny Alahady"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly on Sunady"
msgstr "Isam-bolana amin'ny Alahady"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Background Timeout and Concurrent Process Settings"
msgstr "Fikirakirana ny Fe-potoana Ambadika sy ny Dingana Miaraka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Report Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Fe-potoana Famoronana Tatitra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Reports Generation script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Ny fotoana farafahabetsany ahafahan'ny skripta Famoronana Tatitra an'ny Cacti mandeha tsy miteraka hadisoana fe-potoana tapitra sy tsy voatsahatra an-terisetra."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Minute"
msgstr "%s Minitra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics Timeout"
msgstr "Fetra fotoana ho an'ny antontan'isan'ny loharanon-drakitra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Data Source Statistics script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Ny fotoana farany ambony ahafahan'ny script Antontan'isan'ny loharanon-drakitra an'ny Cacti mandeha nefa tsy miteraka hadisoana fetra fotoana sy tsy voajanona an-keriny."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDChecker Timeout"
msgstr "Fetra fotoana ho an'ny RRDChecker"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's RRDfile check script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Ny fotoana farafahabetsany ahafahan'ny skripta fanamarinana RRDfile an'ny Cacti mandeha tsy miteraka hadisoana fe-potoana tapitra sy tsy voatsahatra an-terisetra."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s Hour"
msgstr "%s Ora"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Commands Timeout"
msgstr "Fetra fotoana ho an'ny baikon'ny Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time Cacti's Background Commands script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed.  This script will perform tasks such as re-indexing Devices and pruning devices from Remote Data Collectors."
msgstr "Ny fotoana farany ambony ahafahan'ny script Baiko ao ambadika an'ny Cacti mandeha nefa tsy miteraka hadisoana fetra fotoana sy tsy voajanona an-keriny. Ity script ity dia hanatanteraka asa toy ny fanavaozana tondro ny Fitaovana sy ny fanesorana fitaovana avy amin'ny Mpanangona angona lavitra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Command Concurrent Processes"
msgstr "Dingana mandeha miaraka ho an'ny baikon'ny Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent Poller Command processes.  The will be at most one concurrent command per host within the Poller Command pool."
msgstr "Ny isan'ny dingan'ny Baikon'ny Poller mandeha miaraka. Hisy baiko iray farafahabetsany mandeha miaraka isaky ny mpampiantrano ao anatin'ny vondron'ny Baikon'ny Poller."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "1 Process"
msgstr "1 Dingana"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Processes"
msgstr "%d Dingana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Fetra fotoana famoronana fikojakojana ao ambadika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Maintenance script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Ny fotoana farany ambony ahafahan'ny script Fikojakojana an'ny Cacti mandeha nefa tsy miteraka hadisoana fetra fotoana sy tsy voajanona an-keriny."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spikekill Background Generation Timeout"
msgstr "Fetra fotoana famoronana Spikekill ao ambadika"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of time a Cacti's Spikekill script can run without generating a timeout error and being killed."
msgstr "Ny fotoana farany ambony ahafahan'ny script Spikekill an'ny Cacti mandeha nefa tsy miteraka hadisoana fetra fotoana sy tsy voajanona an-keriny."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Defaults"
msgstr "Sanda Fototry ny Mpanangona Angona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "These settings are maintained at the Data Collector level.  The values here are only defaults used when first creating a Data Collector."
msgstr "Ireo fikirakirana ireo dia tazonina eo amin'ny sehatry ny Mpanangona Angona. Ireo sanda eto ireo dia sanda fototra ampiasaina voalohany rehefa mamorona Mpanangona Angona ihany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Processes"
msgstr "Dingana ho an'ny Mpanangona Angona"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default number of concurrent processes to execute per Data Collector.  NOTE: Starting from Cacti 1.2, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector.  Moving forward, this value is only a preset for the Data Collector.  Using a higher number when using cmd.php will improve performance.  Performance improvements in Spine are best resolved with the threads parameter.  When using Spine, we recommend a lower number and leveraging threads instead.  When using cmd.php, use no more than 2x the number of CPU cores."
msgstr "Ny isa fototry ny dingana miaraka hotanterahina isaky ny Mpanangona Angona. FANAMARIHANA: Manomboka amin'ny Cacti 1.2, dia ao amin'ny Mpanangona Angona no hitazonana ity fikirakirana ity. Manomboka izao, ity sanda ity dia fametrahana mialoha (preset) ho an'ny Mpanangona Angona ihany. Ny fampiasana isa ambony kokoa rehefa mampiasa cmd.php dia hanatsara ny fahombiazana. Ny fanatsarana ny fahombiazana ao amin'ny Spine dia voavaha tsara indrindra amin'ny alalan'ny masontsivana threads. Rehefa mampiasa Spine, dia manoro hevitra izahay mba hampiasa isa ambany kokoa sy hampiasa threads fa tsy izany. Rehefa mampiasa cmd.php, aza mampiasa mihoatra ny 2x amin'ny isan'ny CPU cores."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Threads per Process"
msgstr "Threads isaky ny Dingana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Cacti 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Ny Isa Fototry ny Threads avela isaky ny dingana. FANAMARIHANA: Manomboka amin'ny Cacti 1.2+, dia ao amin'ny Mpanangona Angona no hitazonana ity fikirakirana ity, ary Fametrahana Mialoha (Preset) fotsiny ity. Ny fampiasana isa ambony kokoa rehefa mampiasa Spine dia hanatsara ny fahombiazana. Na izany aza, ataovy azo antoka fa manana fifandraisana MySQL/MariaDB ampy ianao hanohanana ity fampitahana manaraka ity: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers). Tsy maintsy ataonao azo antoka ihany koa fa manana fifandraisana ambiny ampy ho an'ny fifandraisana fidirana ataon'ny mpampiasa ianao."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Authentication Method"
msgstr "Fomba fanamarinana maha-izy azy"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Cacti handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Cacti.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Cacti resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Fanamarinana ao anatiny</i> - I Cacti no mitantana ny fanamarinana ny mpampiasa, izay ahafahanao mamorona mpampiasa sy manome azy ireo alalana amin'ny faritra samihafa ao amin'ny Cacti.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana fototra Web</i> - Ny mpizara web no mitantana ny fanamarinana. Azo ampidirina na foronina ho azy ny mpampiasa amin'ny fidirana voalohany raha voafaritra ny Mpampiasa Lasitra, raha tsy izany dia ny alalan'ny vahiny voafaritra no ampiasaina.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana LDAP</i> - Ahafahana manamarina amin'ny alalan'ny mpizara LDAP. Hoforonina ho azy ny mpampiasa amin'ny fidirana voalohany raha voafaritra ny Mpampiasa Lasitra, raha tsy izany dia ny alalan'ny vahiny voafaritra no ampiasaina. Raha tsy mandeha ny maodely LDAP an'ny PHP dia tsy hiseho ho safidy azo fidina ny Fanamarinana LDAP.<br><br><i>Fanamarinana sehatra LDAP/AD maromaro</i> - Ahafahan'ny mpitantana manohana vondrona samihafa avy amin'ny lahatahiry LDAP/AD samy hafa hiditra amin'ny loharanon'ny Cacti. Tahaka ny Fanamarinana LDAP ihany, ilaina ny maodely LDAP an'ny PHP mba hampiasana ity fomba ity.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Support Authentication Cookies"
msgstr "Manohana cookie fanamarinana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Raha manamarina ny maha-izy azy ny mpampiasa iray ary misafidy ny 'Tazomy hiditra aho', dia hisy cookie fanamarinana hoforonina ao amin'ny solosain'ny mpampiasa izay mamela io mpampiasa io hijanona ho tafiditra. Tapitra ny fe-potoana maha-manan-kery ny cookie fanamarinana rehefa tsy ampiasaina mandritra ny 90 andro."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Special Users"
msgstr "Mpampiasa manokana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Primary Admin"
msgstr "Mpitantana voalohany"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the primary administrative account that will automatically receive Emails when the Cacti system experiences issues.  To receive these Emails, ensure that your mail settings are correct, and the administrative account has an Email address that is set."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny kaonty mpitantana voalohany izay hahazo mailaka ho azy rehefa sendra olana ny rafitra Cacti. Mba hahazoana ireo mailaka ireo, ataovy azo antoka fa marina ny fikirana mailakao ary manana adiresy mailaka voafaritra ny kaonty mpitantana."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "No User"
msgstr "Tsy misy mpampiasa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Guest User"
msgstr "Mpampiasa vahiny"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the guest user for viewing graphs; is 'No User' by default."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny mpampiasa vahiny hijerena ny tabilao; 'Tsy misy mpampiasa' izany amin'ny fomba mahazatra."

#: include/global_settings.php user_domains.php
msgid "User Template"
msgstr "Lasitra mpampiasa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the user that Cacti will use as a template for new Web Basic and LDAP users; is 'guest' by default.  This user account will be disabled from logging in upon being selected."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny mpampiasa hampiasain'ny Cacti ho lasitra ho an'ny mpampiasa Web Basic sy LDAP vaovao; 'guest' izany amin'ny fomba mahazatra. Tsy ho afaka miditra intsony ity kaonty mpampiasa ity raha vao voafidy."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Authentication Settings"
msgstr "Fikirana fanamarinana fototra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Login Failure Message"
msgstr "Hafatra tsy fahombiazan'ny fidirana fanamarinana fototra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if there are issues mapping the username to a valid Cacti account, the message included here will be displayed to users.  It can include both text and HTML."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa fanamarinana fototra, raha misy olana amin'ny fampifandraisana ny anaran'ny mpampiasa amin'ny kaonty Cacti manankery, dia haseho amin'ny mpampiasa ny hafatra ampidirina eto. Azo ampidirina amin'izany na lahatsoratra na HTML."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Basic Auth Mapfile"
msgstr "Rakitra fampifandraisana fanamarinana fototra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using basic authentication, if the basic account needs to be translated to a different login account, you can specify a CSV file here to map the basic account to the desired login account."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa fanamarinana fototra, raha mila avadika ho kaonty fidirana hafa ny kaonty fototra, dia azonao atao ny mamaritra rakitra CSV eto mba hampifandraisana ny kaonty fototra amin'ny kaonty fidirana irina."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Account Complexity Requirements"
msgstr "Fepetra fahasarotana ho an'ny kaonty eo an-toerana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Minimum Length"
msgstr "Halavany kely indrindra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is minimal length of allowed passwords."
msgstr "Ity no halavany kely indrindra amin'ny tenimiafina ekena."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Mix Case"
msgstr "Mitaky sora-baventy sy sora-madinika mifangaro"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contains both lower and upper-case characters."
msgstr "Mitaky ny tenimiafina vaovao hirakitra sora-madinika sy sora-baventy izany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Number"
msgstr "Mitaky isa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 numerical character."
msgstr "Mitaky ny tenimiafina vaovao hirakitra isa 1 farafahakeliny izany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require Special Character"
msgstr "Mitaky marika manokana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require new passwords to contain at least 1 special character."
msgstr "Mitaky ny tenimiafina vaovao hirakitra marika manokana 1 farafahakeliny izany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Ampiharo amin'ny tenimiafina taloha ny fahasarotana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Mitaky ny tenimiafina taloha rehetra hahafeno ny fepetra fahasarotana vaovao ihany koa izany rehefa miditra. Raha tsy feno, dia hanery hanova tenimiafina."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Fahataperan'ny fe-potoanan'ny kaonty tsy miasa"

#: include/global_settings.php
