msgstr "Andalana tahiry kendrena isaky ny elanelana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Boost updater assigns complete Local Data IDs to contiguous ranges near this row count. A single Local Data ID is never split, so a range can exceed the target. Lower this value to reduce updater memory and query time. The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Ny mpanavao Boost dia manendry ID-na angona eo an-toerana feno ho an'ny elanelana mifampitohy manakaiky io isan'ny andalana io. Tsy misaraka na oviana na oviana ny ID-na angona eo an-toerana tokana, koa mety hihoatra ny tanjona ny elanelana iray. Ahenao io sanda io mba hampihenana ny fitadidian'ny mpanavao sy ny fotoanan'ny fangatahana. 50000 ny sanda tsotra."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Halavan'ny tohan-kevitra farany ambony"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
