msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Raha mihoatra io fotoana fampandehanana io ny Boost poller, dia hisy fampitandremana hapetraka ao amin'ny firaketan'ny Cacti,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Failed RRDs Queued"
msgstr "Isan'ny RRD tsy nahomby fara-fahabetsany ao anaty filaharana"

