msgstr "Seranana TCP ho an'ny fifandraisana voafenina amin'ny mpanelanelana tahiry fiarovana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Ny diantanana an'ny fanalahidy RSA ho an'ny daholobe ampiasain'ny mpanelanelana tahiry fiarovana amin'izao fotoana izao. Ilaina izany mba hanorenana fifandraisana azo itokisana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Fikirana fanesorana fisondrotana tampoka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Fomba fanesorana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Misy fomba fanesorana roa. Ny voalohany, Fiviliana manara-penitra, dia hanala izay santionany mihoatra ny isa X amin'ny fiviliana manara-penitra manalavitra ny salanisan'ny santionany. Ny fomba faharoa, Fiovaovana, dia hanala izay santionany mihoatra ny X% amin'ny salanisan'ny Fiovaovana. Ny fomba Fiovaovana dia mandray an-tanana isa voafaritra amin'ny 'sandan-javatra miavaka'. Ireo dia santionany maningana, toy ny fiakarana tampoka, izay mila esorina amin'ny kajy ny Salanisan'ny Fiovaovana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Fiviliana mahazatra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Mifototra amin'ny Fiovaovana miaraka amin'ny Fanesorana ny Miavaka"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Fomba fanoloana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Misy fomba fanoloana telo. Ny fomba voalohany dia manolo ny fiakarana tampoka amin'ny salan'isan'ny loharanon-drakitra resahina. Ny fomba faharoa dia manolo ny fiakarana tampoka amin'ny 'NaN'. Ny farany dia manolo ny fiakarana tampoka amin'ny sanda tsara fantatra farany hita."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Salan'isa"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "Ireo NaN"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Tsara Fantatra Farany"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Isan'ny fiviliana fenitra"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Izay sanda mihoatra ny salan'isa amin'io isan'ny fiviliana fenitra io dia hesorina. Ny isa tsara dia miankina amin'ny karazana angona hokirakiraina. Manoro hevitra izahay mba tsy ho latsaky ny fiviliana fenitra 5 ny isa."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Fiviliana fenitra %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Isan-jaton'ny Fiovaovana"

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Ity sanda ity dia maneho ny isan-jato ambonin'ny salanisan'ny santionany namboarina rehefa nesorina tao amin'ny santionany ireo sandan-javatra miavaka. Ohatra, ny Isan-jaton'ny Fiovaovana 100%% amin'ny salanisa namboarina 50 dia hanala izay santionany mihoatra ny isa 100 eo amin'ny kisary."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Isan'ny sanda maningana amin'ny Variance"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Ity sanda ity dia maneho ny isan'ny santionany salan'isa ambony sy ambany hesorina amin'ny vondron-tsantionany mialoha ny hikajiana ny Salan'isan'ny Variance. Raha misafidy sanda maningana 5 ianao, dia esorina avokoa na ny salan'isa 5 ambony indrindra na ny 5 ambany indrindra."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "Santionany ambony/ambany %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Fanesorana ambony indrindra isaky ny RRA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Ity sanda ity dia maneho ny isa ambony indrindra amin'ny fiakarana tampoka hesorina amin'ny RRA an'ny grafika iray."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Spikes"
msgstr "Fiakarana tampoka %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDfile Backup Directory"
msgstr "Lahatahiry fitahirizana kopia RRDfile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this directory is not empty, then your original RRDfiles will be backed up to this location."
msgstr "Raha tsy foana ity lahatahiry ity dia hatao kopia tahiry ato amin'ity toerana ity ny RRDfiles tany am-boalohany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Batch Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Fikirakirana fanesorana fiakarana tampoka miaraka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Schedule"
msgstr "Fandaharam-potoana fanesorana"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Do you wish to periodically remove spikes from your graphs?  If so, select the frequency below."
msgstr "Tianao ve ny hanesorana tsindraindray ny fiakarana tampoka amin'ny grafikanao? Raha eny dia fidio eto ambany ny fahatetehany."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Once a Day"
msgstr "Indray mandeha isan'andro"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Every Other Day"
msgstr "Isaky ny roa andro"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Base Time"
msgstr "Ora fototra"

