#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Soso-kevitra MAFY ny handefasanao ny InnoDB amin'ny dikan-teny %s rehetra mihoatra ny 5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa ny Cacti amin'ny fiteny hafa ankoatra ny teny anglisy dia zava-dehibe ny fampiasana ny karazana fandaharana utf8mb4_unicode_ci satria misy litera mitaky mihoatra ny octet tokana."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Cacti with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa ny Cacti amin'ny fiteny hafa ankoatra ny teny anglisy dia zava-dehibe ny fampiasana ny andian-tsoratra utf8mb4 satria misy litera mitaky mihoatra ny octet tokana."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Soso-kevitra ny handefasanao ny InnoDB amin'ny dikan-teny %s rehetra mihoatra ny 5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Arakaraka ny isan'ny fidirana sy ny fampiasana ny mpanangona angona Spine, dia mila fifandraisana maro ny %s. Ny kajy ho an'ny Spine dia: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), avy eo tsy maintsy mamela elanelana ho an'ny fifandraisan'ny mpampiasa ianao, izay hiovaova arakaraka ny isan'ny kaonty miditra miaraka."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Ny fitazonana ny cache-n'ny tabilao ho lehibe kokoa dia midika hoe vitsy kokoa ny asa fanokafana/fanakatonana rakitra rehefa mampiasa innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Miaraka amin'ny fahaiza-manao fakana angona lavitra, dia angona betsaka no hampifanarahina avy amin'ny mpizara fototra mankany amin'ny mpanangona angona lavitra. Noho izany, tazomy ho 16M na mihoatra io sanda io."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Cacti Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Raha mampiasa ny Cacti Performance Booster ianao ary misafidy motera fitahirizana anaty fitadidiana, dia tsy maintsy mitandrina ianao hanadio ny buffer-n'ny Performance Booster alohan'ny hahalany ny habaka ho an'ny tabilao anaty fitadidiana ao amin'ny rafitra. Azo atao amin'ny fomba roa izany: voalohany, ny fampihenana ny haben'ny tsanganana famoahana ho amin'ny habe sahaza indrindra. Ao amin'ny tabilao poller_output sy poller_output_boost io tsanganana io. Ny zavatra faharoa azonao atao dia ny manokana fitadidiana bebe kokoa ho an'ny tabilao anaty fitadidiana. Nisafidy sanda atolotra 10%% amin'ny fitadidian'ny rafitra izahay, saingy raha mampiasa kapila SSD ianao, na manana rafitra kely kokoa, dia azonao atao ny tsy miraharaha ity soso-kevitra ity na misafidy motera fitahirizana hafa. Azonao jerena ny fandaniana andrasana ho an'ny tabilao Performance Booster ao amin'ny Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Rehefa manatanteraka fangatahana anatiny (subqueries), ny fananana haben'ny tabilao vonjimaika lehibe kokoa dia mitazona ireo tabilao vonjimaika ireo ao anaty fitadidiana."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Rehefa manao fampifandraisana (joins), raha kely noho izao habeny izao izy ireo, dia hotehirizina ao amin'ny fitadidiana (memory) fa tsy hosoratana ao amin'ny rakitra vonjimaika mihitsy. Satria fitsinjarana fitadidiana isaky ny fifandraisana ity, dia mila mitandrina mba tsy hampitombo azy io ho ambony loatra. Ny fitambaran'ny join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + fitadidiana fototra MySQL/MariaDB dia tokony ho latsaky ny 80%. Raha miiba ny soso-kevitra, dia tsy maintsy ahenanao ity sy/na ny sort_buffer_size mandra-pahatongan'ny soso-kevitra ho ao anatin'ny fitadidiana azo ekena."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa ny fitahirizana InnoDB dia zava-dehibe ny mitazona ny habaky ny tabilao ho misaraka. Izany dia manamora ny fitantanana ny tabilao ho an'ireo mpampiasa efa ela ny %s. Raha maty io endri-javatra io amin'izao fotoana izao, dia azonao atao ny mifindra amin'ny fitahirizana isaky ny rakitra amin'ny alalan'ny fampandehanana ilay endri-javatra, ary avy eo dia manatanteraka baikon'ny fanovana (ALTER) amin'ny tabilao InnoDB rehetra."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Cacti tables."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa ny innodb_file_per_table, dia zava-dehibe ny mametraka ny innodb_file_format ho Barracuda. Ity fandaharana ity dia ahafahana manana tondro (indexes) lava kokoa izay zava-dehibe ho an'ny tabilao Cacti sasany."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "Raha manana tondro (indexes) lehibe dia lehibe ny tabilaonao, dia tsy maintsy miasa amin'ny innodb_file_format Barracuda sy innodb_large_prefix mitovy amin'ny 1 ianao. Ny tsy fanatanterahana izany dia mety hahatonga ny plugins tsy hahavita hamorona tabilao araka ny tokony ho izy."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size."
msgstr "Mitazona latabatra sy tondro (indexes) betsaka araka izay azo atao ao amin'ny fitadidian'ny rafitra ny InnoDB. Noho izany, tokony hataonao lehibe ampy hitazonana ny ankamaroan'ny latabatra sy tondro ao amin'ny fitadidiana ny innodb_buffer_pool. Hanampy amin'ny famaritana io sanda io ny fanamarinana ny haben'ny lahatahiry /var/lib/mysql/cacti. Manoro hevitra izahay ny 25%% amin'ny fitambaran'ny fitadidian'ny rafitrao, fa hiovaova arakaraka ny haben'ny rafitrao ny zavatra ilainao."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This settings should remain ON unless your Cacti instances is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Tokony hijanona ho ON ity fikirakirana ity raha tsy hoe mandeha amin'ny ZFS na FusionI/O ny Cacti-nao, izay samy manana firaketana anatiny (journaling) hiatrehana ny fahatapahan'ny rafitra tampoka. Na izany aza, raha manana herinaratra tsara dia tsara ianao, ary mahalana vao maty ny rafitrao sady manana dika fiarovana ianao, ny famadihana ity fikirakirana ity ho OFF dia afaka mitondra fitomboan'ny fahombiazan'ny banky angona efa ho 50%."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Eto no itehirizana ny metadata. Raha manana tabilao maro ianao dia ilaina ny mampitombo ity sanda ity."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Tsy tokony hanery ny angon-drakitra ho tapaka ho an'ny hafa ny fangatahana mandeha tsy ara-dalàna. Atsaharo ireo fangatahana ireo alohan'ny hanimbany ny rafitrao."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Ny fahombiazana ambony indrindra amin'ny I/O dia mitranga rehefa mampiasa ny fomba O_DIRECT ianao handefasana ny pejy."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Ny fametrahana ity sanda ity ho 2 dia midika fa handefa ny fifanakalozana rehetra isan-tsegondra ianao fa tsy isaky ny fanamafisana (commit). Izany dia ahafahan'ny %s manoratra mahalana kokoa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy io maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo lenta."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, the you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Hatramin'ny %1$s %2$s, azonao fehezina ny fahatetehan'ny fandefasan'ny %3$s ny fifanakalozana mankany amin'ny kapila. 1 segondra ny mahazatra, saingy amin'ny rafitra manana I/O avo dia ny fametrahana sanda mihoatra ny 1 no ahafahan'ny I/O amin'ny kapila mandeha milamina kokoa"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy io famakiana maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo lenta. Arakaraka ny kinovan'ny MariaDB/MySQL ampiasainao, ity sanda ity dia mety hahatratra hatramin'ny 64. Nefa andramo tazonina ho latsaky ny fitambaran'ny kofehy SMT ao amin'ny lohamilin'ny angon-drakitrao ny isa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy io fanoratana maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo lenta. Arakaraka ny kinovan'ny MariaDB/MySQL ampiasainao, ity sanda ity dia mety hahatratra hatramin'ny 64. Nefa andramo tazonina ho latsaky ny fitambaran'ny kofehy SMT ao amin'ny lohamilin'ny angon-drakitrao ny isa."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "Ny %s dia hizara ny innodb_buffer_pool ho faritra fitadidiana maromaro mba hanatsarana ny fahombiazana ho an'ny kinovan'ny MariaDB latsaky ny 10.5. Ny sanda ambony indrindra dia 64, saingy tsy tokony hihoatra ny isan'ny CPU cores/threads. Rehefa latsaky ny 1GB ny innodb_buffer_pool-nao dia tokony hampiasa ny haben'ny pool nozaraina 128MB ianao. Tohizo ny fampiasana io kajy io hatramin'ny ambony indrindra amin'ny isan'ny CPU cores na 64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "Ny %s dia hizara ny innodb_buffer_pool ho faritra fitadidiana maromaro mba hanatsarana ny fahombiazana ho an'ny kinovan'ny MySQL hatramin'ny MySQL 8.0. Ny sanda ambony indrindra dia 64, saingy tsy tokony hihoatra ny isan'ny CPU cores/threads. Rehefa latsaky ny 1GB ny innodb_buffer_pool-nao dia tokony hampiasa ny haben'ny pool nozaraina 128MB ianao. Tohizo ny fampiasana io kajy io hatramin'ny ambony indrindra amin'ny isan'ny CPU cores na 64."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Raha manana kapila SSD ianao dia ampiasao ity soso-kevitra ity. Raha manana kapila mafy ara-batana ianao dia ampiasao ny 200 * isan'ny kapila miasa ao amin'ny laharan-kapila. Raha mampiasa NVMe na PCIe Flash dia azo ampiasaina ny isa lehibe lavitra hatramin'ny 100000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Raha manana kapila SSD ianao dia ampiasao ity soso-kevitra ity. Raha manana kapila mafy ara-batana ianao dia ampiasao ny 2000 * isan'ny kapila miasa ao amin'ny laharan-kapila. Raha mampiasa NVMe na PCIe Flash dia azo ampiasaina ny isa lehibe lavitra hatramin'ny 200000."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, set this to 0. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Raha manana kapila SSD ianao dia apetraho ho 0 ity. Raha tsy izany dia aza mametraka ity fikirakirana ity."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy io famakiana maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo lenta."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Amin'ny fitahirizana karazana SSD maoderina, ny fananana kofehy io fanoratana maro dia mahasoa ho an'ny rindranasa manana toetra io avo lenta."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa MariaDB 10.2.4 sy ny ambony dia tokony ho off ity fikirakirana ity raha alefa ny fanoratana atomika (atomic writes). Noho izany, alefaso ny fanoratana atomika fa tsy ny double write buffer satria hampitombo ny fahombiazana izany."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Rehefa mampiasa MariaDB 10.2.4 sy ny ambony dia azonao ampiasaina ny fanoratana atomika (atomic writes) fa tsy ny doublewrite buffer mba hampitomboana ny fahombiazana."

